  "description": "A classic, stirred up.\nThe Martini is a compact electric bike designed to feel natural from the first ride – comfortable, confident, and easy to live with. It’s built around a simple single-speed drivetrain, a quiet belt drive, and a powerful hub motor that smooths out hills and headwinds without overcomplicating the ride.\nWith 50+ miles of range, throttle and pedal assist, and geometry designed to fit riders from 5'3\" to 6'3\", the Martini works just as well for quick errands as it does for longer, unplanned detours. Small wheels keep it nimble in tight spaces, while the steel frame and relaxed posture keep it feeling steady and composed.\nWhat it’s like to own the Martini:\n\n500W electric assist that makes starts, hills, and longer rides feel effortless\n\nMaintenance-free Gates carbon belt drive — clean, quiet, and built to last\n\nSingle-speed simplicity with fewer parts to adjust or worry about\n\nCompact 20\" wheels that are easy to maneuver, store, and transport\n\nProfessionally assembled at a local bike shop and ready to ride from day one\n\nThe Martini is about riding more often – and enjoying it every time you do.\nCertified to UL 2849 by ACT Labs LLC. View certificate.\nBattery certified to UL 2271 by MET Labs.",
